Package: fhktools
Title: Robust Foster-Haltiwanger-Krizan Productivity Decompositions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yu", "Li", email = "ylxmu1019@163.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements defensive two-period and multi-period
    Foster-Haltiwanger-Krizan productivity decompositions following
    Foster, Haltiwanger, and Krizan (2001) <doi:10.3386/w6803>.
    The package supports raw size weights or pre-computed shares,
    grouped and economy-wide results, sample-entry and sample-exit audits,
    optional business activity-window validation, group movers,
    incomplete groups, multiple productivity measures, and strict
    accounting-identity checks. It is designed to make consequential
    data choices explicit rather than silently repair problematic inputs.
